## DLL and Module Load Investigation

### Review Loaded DLLs

**Purpose:** Review DLL and module loads associated with a process on a device.

```kusto
DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where DeviceName has "<DEVICE>"
| where FileName contains "<DLL_NAME>"
```

### CLR Unbacked Module – FastMember

**Purpose:** Identify FastMember dynamic assemblies loaded in .NET processes.

```kusto
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType == "ClrUnbackedModuleLoaded"
| extend ModuleILPathOrName = tostring(todynamic(AdditionalFields).ModuleILPathOrName)
| where ModuleILPathOrName =~ @"FastMember_dynamic"
| summarize count() by DeviceName
```

### CLR Unbacked Module – Razor Templates

**Purpose:** Review RazorEngine dynamic template execution. To track one specific template, replace the `has` filter with the full module name (including its hash suffix).

```kusto
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType == "ClrUnbackedModuleLoaded"
| extend ModuleILPathOrName = tostring(todynamic(AdditionalFields).ModuleILPathOrName)
| where ModuleILPathOrName has "CompiledRazorTemplates.Dynamic.RazorEngine_"
| summarize count_distinct(DeviceName) by InitiatingProcessFileName
```

