## Scheduled Task Investigation

### Suspicious SchTasks Activity

**Purpose:** Investigate suspicious scheduled task creation and archive (`tar`) activity.

```kusto
DeviceProcessEvents
| where
    (ProcessCommandLine has "schtasks" and ProcessCommandLine has "/create")
    or (ProcessCommandLine contains "cmd /c" and ProcessCommandLine has "tar")
    or (ProcessCommandLine contains "cmd /c" and ProcessCommandLine has "null")
    or (ProcessCommandLine contains "timeout /t" and ProcessCommandLine has "tar")
| project
    Timestamp,
    DeviceName,
    AccountName,
    ProcessCommandLine
```

