## WMI and RPC Investigation

### RPC Activity Investigation

**Purpose:** Investigate WMI and RPC-related execution paths (RPCSS service) and the processes that spawned them.

```kusto
DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "RPCSS"
    or InitiatingProcessCommandLine contains "RPCSS"
| project
    Timestamp,
    DeviceName,
    AccountName,
    InitiatingProcessParentFileName,
    InitiatingProcessFileName,
    InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
    FileName,
    ProcessCommandLine
| order by Timestamp desc
```

